# Actors: spawn a worker, send it a number, and let it print the number.
#
# SpawnActor leaves the new process on the stack above the message that was
# pushed for it. SendMessage takes that message and leaves the actor behind, so
# the same actor can be sent to again.

42
SpawnActor .worker
SendMessage
Pop
Jump .done

.worker
ReceiveMessage
io.print CallNative 1
Return

.done
Return
